letter:
    date: "September 18, 2025"
    opening: "Dear Hiring Manager,"
    enclosure: "Enclosure: Resume"
    body: |
        I am excited to apply for the Software Engineer position at Appian Corporation. My expertise in Java and Python, combined with proven experience building scalable, reliable platforms, aligns perfectly with Appian's mission to automate complex business processes through innovative low-code solutions.

        At Simons Foundation and University of Louisiana Monroe, I designed and implemented high-performance systems handling terabyte-scale datasets and 30,000+ files, achieving 99.9% uptime through robust architecture and proactive monitoring. My experience with Java Spring Boot, Python, and scalable system design has prepared me to contribute to Appian's platform that enables customers to design, automate, and optimize their most complex processes.

        I am passionate about building software that runs software and thrive in collaborative, high-standards environments like Appian's McLean headquarters. Your values of Intensity and Excellence resonate with my approach to engineering reliable, scalable solutions that solve real-world business challenges.

        Thank you for your consideration. I look forward to contributing to Appian's mission of helping organizations achieve better growth and superior customer experiences.

        Sincerely,
        Dinesh Chhantyal"Dinesh Chhantyal"
