letter:
    date: "September 18, 2025"
    opening: "Dear Hiring Manager,"
    enclosure: "Enclosure: Resume"
    body: |
        I am excited to apply for the Staff Data Warehouse Engineer position at BILL. My background in building scalable data pipelines and optimizing ETL workflows with Python and SQL aligns well with your mission to empower businesses through innovative financial automation.

        At Simons Foundation, I developed and maintained robust data pipelines for large scientific datasets, collaborating with analytics and product teams to deliver actionable insights. My experience designing ETL processes and ensuring data quality has prepared me to contribute to BILL’s data ecosystem and support business operations.

        I am passionate about leveraging data to solve real-world problems and thrive in fast-paced, collaborative environments. I look forward to the opportunity to bring my skills in data engineering and cross-functional teamwork to BILL.

        Thank you for your consideration.

        Sincerely,
        Dinesh Chhantyal
